  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-picnic-vote-v3-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "c9e0d1ef9fe3b30d570cda94b6d8e71002e2825220ef4e26b925ec51f262509d",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c737bad5bac19f20ed2d52b6f6c558c6093f0e3fec02a1d8f43151beea56cc85",
      "text": "野餐玩什么？",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2a7d0e0a5e04afb2aa16ce7dbaa4ac9991acd0a37cbfa8265678b717290c13ed",
      "text": "六个好朋友在桃子草坡上野餐。\n午饭吃得精光。\n悟空说：“该玩游戏啦！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8f1acd85854d7a661d417832507bbc6abb846ed5ed3f690067fcf7466e369425",
      "text": "铁扇公主带了风筝，\n哪吒带了泡泡水，\n玉兔带了蜡笔。\n三个好选择！先玩哪个呢？\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0e3915a9321c92748810da65e67e45ac1fa6fd666fe9789852e15ff77989c063",
      "text": "“放风筝！”“吹泡泡！”“画画！”\n大家七嘴八舌，一起嚷嚷。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "58ef450676657b35592de49c657cb10749dba499c2b6a74ebf06428c3968a691",
      "text": "悟空喊得最响：\n“风筝！风筝！风筝！”\n“谁的声音大，就听谁的！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "79ee812c51755177e69c3cb1f3a3af909148259d4bce428715e24564ae31b5ea",
      "text": "结果大家喊得更响了。\n这下谁也听不见谁！\n八戒赶紧捂住耳朵。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c2ccbee210591cc84c80f9b3f04a0b1792beb0cfdf1f30f55644755cc03835f9",
      "text": "玉兔拿出一张纸，\n画了一张分成三列的图表。\n每一列是一个选择。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "55458e20f6cce936992d75d21dda9054fa2633bb5290e0861d0171e32a1b40f3",
      "text": "她给每人发一张星星贴纸。\n玉兔说：“一人一张贴纸，\n这就是你的一票。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bdd230ac1628ee59482be471ee30e5c2686e12b13025aceb3fcd821e1a7c3dbc",
      "text": "玉兔说：“贴纸从最下面贴起，\n中间不留空。”\n悟空把贴纸贴在风筝那一列。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec673cc497fe66bce9d910a48931c0cc3d972beea4665364a4a7fa7a79828a03",
      "text": "敖丙也选了风筝。\n八戒选了泡泡：\n“我最爱戳泡泡啦！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c8d1fdedf07c32d1ebb69b6f98789decfeee4adf0713dfc9c6d1d60080f8ab2c",
      "text": "哪吒也选了泡泡。\n铁扇公主选了风筝：\n“这个坡上的风最好啦！”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bcbdec4f1f4ea3edad3483b7562bcb0c719a3b072b7e06bc617e8abe3f199f78",
      "text": "玉兔把贴纸贴在画画那一列。\n六个朋友，六张贴纸，\n大家都投好票了！\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4181b2d205755206d9e7dc49ef1bfd61a1534da4baaed07f26125519a200a5ae",
      "text": "风筝三票，\n泡泡两票，\n画画一票。\n哪一列最高，哪一个的票\n就最多！\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "023c112d398d0ab664decf23e60c7e8d9e23d4477b0a0109c01f258c15b1817f",
      "text": "图表上看得清清楚楚：\n风筝的票最多，\n泡泡和画画少一些。\n铁扇公主说：“先放风筝，\n再吹泡泡、画画！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "01ebd4ed08eca1ca33fb9ae368244c69120915161d2c36c801a752e8093cd82f",
      "text": "八戒问：“能不能加第四列？\n‘再吃一回点心’！”\n大家都笑了。\n玉兔把它记在新的一页上，下次\n野餐用。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f77392f7cbf9edc8dc11db952c4439d04c79aecb8de439080389c9152d28a560",
      "text": "风筝飞呀飞，飞上了天！\n接着大家吹泡泡，\n最后玉兔给每个人画了像。\n谁也不用扯着嗓子喊啦。\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec4df2cb93b7c9510e763d90f22b8a350c71d1d514885ba4d4c68e844fdb41c9",
